WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Emulator, Quest 3. A light peeks over the real armchair; depth occlusion hides the rest.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.600
Point the hand ray and pinch. The light pops where it hid.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.200
It flies to your palm, then rises to your ceiling.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.500
It lands as a star, and a line joins it to the last one.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Five catches later, the constellation on your ceiling has grown.
